      "summary": "Asparagus tossed in neutral oil and grilled until lightly charred, finished with lemon juice or sesame oil.",
      "method_md": "## 3️⃣ Grilled Asparagus (Clean & Bright)\n**Ingredients**\n- 1 bunch asparagus\n- 1–1½ tbsp neutral oil\n- Fine sea salt\n- Finish: lemon juice **or** a few drops sesame oil (choose one)\n**Method**\n1. Snap off woody ends.\n2. Toss with oil and light salt.\n3. Grill over medium–high heat:\n\t- Roll occasionally\n\t- Until lightly charred and just tender (3–4 min)\n4. Finish off heat with lemon **or** sesame oil.",
